description:
List the sites that follow one of your Nekoweb sites, with each one's domain, title, link, screenshot and whether you follow it back. Only works for sites on your own account.

Requires the optional session token (NEKOWEB_SESSION_TOKEN). If it isn't set, this tool returns setup steps to pass on to the user.

Without 'page', every page of followers is fetched (up to 20 pages). For just the follower count, nekoweb_get_site_info is quicker and needs no session token.

Examples:
  - "Who follows my site?" -> {}
  - "Which of my followers updated most recently?" -> { sort: "recently_updated" }
  - "Who follows my other site?" -> { site: "second.nekoweb.org" }
